commit 2bef0b2f6901c432c48ce274af91b7c34b908942

C03: seeing the Steam library is the read-only local listing, reported as count and names (GAMES1531)

«Ver la biblioteca de Steam» reached no reader: the catalog listing accepted only «lista/muestra … biblioteca … steam», and the composer had no projection for the game listing. The reader now accepts ver/mirar/mostrame/muéstrame/dame/quiero ver, and `game.catalog.list` (local appmanifests, Steam never launched) is projected like the known-folder listing: how many games are installed and their names exactly as listed, with its own instruction and the same quoted-name and count veto.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


